import H0mework.Versions.Re60a8605.ReleaseMaterials.SaturationMonoid.ProcessGame.Regression.Society.M14.Fixture.EssentialAccess.ActualUpdate.Selection.Append.CrossCompiler.Readout.Recognition.Source.SourceGeneratedActualRelationCycleMemoryWitnessPublication

/-!
# Source-generated M14 culture observer-kernel bundle

The three members evaluate one current target role through the incoming-role
queries generated by the fixed M14 actual relation cycle.  Their joint visible
image identifies the renewed depths `base + 3` and `base`, while the exact
cross-action presentations remain different authority occurrences.

The existing cycle-memory publication then refines this exact joint kernel
pair into a shared-lineage observation.  This file creates no culture carrier,
consumer quotient, communication network, root, or institutional revision.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

namespace SaturationMonoid
namespace NoIslandNoMagic
namespace Consciousness
namespace Culture
namespace M14
namespace SharedKernel

open ProcessGame Society
open ResponsibilityLifecycle LivingLawEvolution ConstructiveRoot
open ConstructiveRoot.RootInquiryCompletion
